# Kipuka EST — OTP Inventory
Output docs/gifs/05-est-otp-list.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# Active OTP Inventory — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-otp-list -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 4s
